step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>With one free inventory space, talk to <col=800000>Mosol Rei</col> outside of Shilo Village. A <col=800000>gnome glider</col> is nearby, as well as <col=800000>fairy ring</col> CKR.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>With one free inventory space, talk to Mosol Rei outside of Shilo Village. A gnome glider is nearby, as well as fairy ring CKR.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the <col=800000>wampum belt</col> on <col=800000>Trufitus</col>, found in the most north-eastern house in <col=800000>Tai Bwo Wannai</col> (quest icon on minimap). Fairy ring CKR is nearby.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>With one free inventory space, talk to Mosol Rei outside of Shilo Village. A gnome glider is nearby, as well as fairy ring CKR.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the wampum belt on Trufitus, found in the most north-eastern house in Tai Bwo Wannai (quest icon on minimap). Fairy ring CKR is nearby.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Follow the chat options once you've used the belt on him.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>With one free inventory space, talk to Mosol Rei outside of Shilo Village. A gnome glider is nearby, as well as fairy ring CKR.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the wampum belt on Trufitus, found in the most north-eastern house in Tai Bwo Wannai (quest icon on minimap). Fairy ring CKR is nearby.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the chat options once you've used the belt on him.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head to the temple of <col=800000>Ah Za Rhoon</col> south-west of the <col=800000>Shipyard</col> and east of <col=800000>Shilo Village</col> across the River Amja (the pile of rocks on the minimap). Use a gnome glider or Fairy ring DKP, or walk there by crossing the wooden log to the east, then head south until you reach a mound of earth surrounded by rocks.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>With one free inventory space, talk to Mosol Rei outside of Shilo Village. A gnome glider is nearby, as well as fairy ring CKR.</str>
