line	<str>Head to the temple of Ah Za Rhoon south-west of the Shipyard and east of Shilo Village across the River Amja (the pile of rocks on the minimap). Use a gnome glider or Fairy ring DKP, or walk there by crossing the wooden log to the east, then head south until you reach a mound of earth surrounded by rocks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your spade on the mound of earth.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a lit torch or candle on the fissure, then use your rope on the fissure. You will lose the item.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the fissure (32 Agility) to climb down and follow the cave south until you reach the stream.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the cave-in at 2 to enter a new cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the loose rocks at 6 to find a tattered scroll. Read the scroll.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the sacks at 7 to find a crumpled scroll. Read the scroll.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the ancient gallows at 8 to get the Zadimus corpse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport out, or head back to the first area via the Cave in at 2.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the Tribal Statue near Trufitus' hut and bury the corpse.</str>
line	
line	<str>With your bronze wire and chisel, head south-west to Cairn Isle, west of Shilo Village, near fairy ring CKR. Climb the rocks (15 Agility) and then cross the bridge.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the well stacked rocks on the northern side of the island, and then enter the crevice, requiring (32 Agility). If you can't get in the cave you didn't read the Tattered Scroll.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head south and with at least 3 empty inventory spaces search the dolmen. If you had no space you'll have to return with charcoal and papyrus to get the notes. Do not drop the locating crystal or you will take 5-10 damage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a chisel on the sword pommel to craft the bone beads.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use bronze wire on the bone beads to create the Beads of the Dead necklace. You must read the Crumpled Scroll before you can create them.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport out or climb up the rockslide nearby to escape the cave (may take up to 10 damage if you fail).</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare for the fight against Nazastarool. Crumble Undead is useful alongside Protect from Melee.</str>
line	
line	<str>With your three regular bones, bone shard and chisel, head south-east from fairy ring DKP to the north-eastern dot on the Karamja map above.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the unique bright green palm tree from the north side to find two doors.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the doors to find the keyhole.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your chisel on the bone shard to make a bone key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the Beads of the Dead then use the key on the doors.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the ancient gate (while wearing the Beads of the Dead necklace), then climb down the rocks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run west, south, then south-west through the dungeon to reach a pair of doors.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use (don't bury) 3 regular <col=800000>bones</col> on the <col=800000>doors</col> (can kill skeletons, not zombies for the bones if you forgot).</col>
